  <title>SET POINT Command</title>
  <keywords>
    <keyword>Commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET commands</keyword>
    <keyword>SET POINT command</keyword>
  </keywords>
  <body>
    <header>
      <para styleclass="Heading1">SET POINT Command</para>
    </header>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__FoxProOnly" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><snippet src="__CommandInclude" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">用途</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">指定在数字表达式中用作小数分隔符的字符。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">语法</para>
    <para styleclass="Code with box">SET POINT TO [&lt;cCharacter&gt;]</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参数</para>
    <para styleclass="List">&lt;cCharacter&gt;<tab />十进制分隔符。若省略该字符，分隔符将重置为小数点（&quot;.&quot;）。</para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">备注</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal">该设置以 Set.Point 的形式存储在运行时状态中，其值与 <link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetDecimalSep.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetDecimalSep()</link> 函数所修改的设置相同。</para>
    <para styleclass="Body Text"><snippet src="__IncludeLibVFP" inline="false"/></para>
    <para styleclass="Heading1">参见</para>
    <para styleclass="Normal"><link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_SEPARATOR">SET SEPARATOR</link>、<link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="command_SET_DECIMALS">SET DECIMALS</link>、<link displaytype="text" defaultstyle="true" type="topiclink" href="html\Overload_XSharp_Core_Functions_SetDecimalSep.htm" domain="XSharpRef.chm">SetDecimalSep()</link></para>
  </body>
</topic>
